{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/learn/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/page,_N_T_/learn/qiu-yonghan-money-philosophy"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--2DJ2zhzL_dHSrK5QsdDKA--><html lang=\"zh-TW\" data-density=\"comfortable\" data-font-size=\"standard\" class=\"__variable_07e1b6 __variable_cc7473 h-full antialiased\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/3d26d2f3aa81a833-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/604a121a6fa1a135-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/6e1768769e6f59a2-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ab2e3a11646b0499-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/75c047ba52e43fcc.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/aa90c9a426448e43.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/e55779c04dd245e2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/8c57d5c3b938342e.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/3eaf36e367672966.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-100b9d70ed4e49c1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1255-ab54a41c275880be.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-acf4587a940f1946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/learn/%5Bslug%5D/page-f7b99344f7e2ee16.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>邱永漢看市場留下什麼？3句常被誤當成密技的話｜股市大佬 TradeBoss</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"邱永漢寫過大量關於錢、工作與市場的公開文字，在台灣流傳很廣。句子短、比喻多，所以常被截成密技。比較穩的讀法是把他當「幫你少被一句話騙走」的作者，不是當報價機器。三句特別常被截：趨勢比面子重要、不要只會一種賺錢方式、以及價格會反映群眾心情。三句都有用，也都能被讀壞。\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-theme');if(t!=='light'&&t!=='dark')t='dark';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);document.documentElement.style.colorScheme=(t==='light'?'light':'dark');}catch(e){document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme','dark');}})();(function(){try{if(localStorage.getItem('obsidian-comfort-read')==='1')document.documentElement.classList.add('comfort-read');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var s=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-updown');if(s==='us')document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-updown','us');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var prefs=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('bs-preferences-v1')||'{}');var root=document.documentElement;prefs=prefs&&typeof prefs==='object'?prefs:{};root.setAttribute('data-font-size',['standard','large','xlarge','huge'].indexOf(prefs.fontSize)>=0?prefs.fontSize:'standard');root.setAttribute('data-density',prefs.density==='compact'?'compact':'comfortable');}catch(e){}})();</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground selection:bg-cyan/30 review-mode pb-40 lg:pb-16\" data-review-theme=\"dark\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-link fixed left-3 top-3 z-[80] -translate-y-24 rounded-xl bg-accent px-4 py-2 font-black text-bg shadow-lg transition focus:translate-y-0\">跳到主要內容</a><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_wrap__LIQ8G\"><article class=\"LearnArticle_article__2nBbk\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_meta__etj_G\"><a class=\"LearnArticle_cat__GQMlg\" href=\"/learn?c=stories\">人物與市場史</a><span class=\"LearnArticle_read__QEj6a\">閱讀約 3 分鐘</span></p><h1 class=\"LearnArticle_title__0_la8\">邱永漢看市場留下什麼？3句常被誤當成密技的話</h1><details class=\"LearnArticle_toc__LcSAa\"><summary class=\"LearnArticle_tocSummary__YBddG\">本文目錄</summary><ol class=\"LearnArticle_tocList__Rq_Lz\"><li><a href=\"#sec-1\">一、為什麼華文讀者特別常引用他</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-2\">二、三句還原</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-3\">三、和葛拉漢、鄧普頓的距離</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-4\">四、作家不是交易員教材的例外</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-5\">五、最小動作</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-6\">常見問題 FAQ</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-7\">總結</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-8\">延伸閱讀</a></li></ol></details><div class=\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\">邱永漢寫過大量關於錢、工作與市場的公開文字，在台灣流傳很廣。句子短、比喻多，所以常被截成密技。比較穩的讀法是把他當「幫你少被一句話騙走」的作者，不是當報價機器。三句特別常被截：趨勢比面子重要、不要只會一種賺錢方式、以及價格會反映群眾心情。三句都有用，也都能被讀壞。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\"><b class=\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\">本文重點</b><ul class=\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\"><li>好記的句子要還原成界線，才不會變成口訣</li><li>趨勢可以承認，承認不是叫你追每一段</li><li>多元收入與市場判斷是兩題，不要焊在同一張單上</li></ul></div><section id=\"sec-1\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">一、為什麼華文讀者特別常引用他</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">語言近、例子生活化、不故作學院。這是優點，也讓句子容易脫離語境。脫離語境之後，任何漲跌都能貼一句邱永漢，貼完好像做了研究。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>好讀所以好截</li><li>截完像研究</li><li>其實只是氣氛</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-2\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">二、三句還原</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">第一，承認大方向，比堅持自己一定對有用——這是認錯，不是追高口號。第二，工作與投資都不要只有一個來源——這是生存，不是叫你同時做十檔。第三，群眾高興與沮喪會進價格——這是市場先生的華文親戚，不是當日反向鈴。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\"><table class=\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\"><thead><tr><th>被截成</th><th>比較近的原意</th><th>誤用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>跟著趨勢走</td><td>少跟面子死守</td><td>每一段都追</td></tr><tr><td>要會賺錢</td><td>來源不要單一</td><td>同時十檔當分散</td></tr><tr><td>看人心</td><td>價格含情緒</td><td>當日反向按鈕</td></tr><tr><td>他說過所以對</td><td>句子要配你的規則</td><td>用名言代替作業</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"sec-3\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">三、和葛拉漢、鄧普頓的距離</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">都承認情緒進價格。葛拉漢用合夥人比喻，鄧普頓用悲觀溫度，邱永漢用生活口吻。口吻不同，作業相同：情緒是背景，規則是行動。</p><ol class=\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\"><li>把名言當背景</li><li>把規則當行動</li><li>不要用名言下單</li></ol><figure class=\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\">!每段都追!名言當策略!用氣氛代替作業</div><figcaption class=\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\">截壞</figcaption></figure></section><section id=\"sec-4\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">四、作家不是交易員教材的例外</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">他更常以寫作者與觀察者被閱讀。這反而安全：你比較不會去抄一筆不存在的「邱永漢部位」。危險的是把專欄句子當成當日策略。人物文契約同樣適用：不寫績效，不學神操作，只留界線。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>觀察者句子當界線</li><li>不當日策略</li><li>不去編造他的部位</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-5\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">五、最小動作</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">下次想轉貼一句名言再下單，改成：這句話對應我的哪一條規則？對應不上，就只轉貼，不下單。</p></section><section id=\"sec-6\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">常見問題 FAQ</h2><div class=\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\"><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>他的話適不適合長輩讀者？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">口吻友善。仍要提醒：名言不能代替規則與風險上限。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>趨勢那句是不是叫人追高？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">較近的是少為面子死守。追每一段是誤讀。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>和是川銀藏誰比較值得讀？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">一個常被寫成戰役，一個常被寫成生活觀念。都要去神化，都只留檢查。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>名言能不能當教學標題？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">能當鉤子。正文必須還原界線，否則就是再傳播口訣。</p></details></div></section><section id=\"sec-7\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">總結</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">邱永漢的句子好記，所以容易變口訣。還原成：少為面子死守、來源不要單一、情緒會進價格。名言對不上規則，就只讀不下單。</p></section><section id=\"sec-8\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">延伸閱讀</h2><ul class=\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\"><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/graham-mr-market-three-checks\">葛拉漢市場先生</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/ishikawa-ginzo-lessons\">是川銀藏</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/templeton-pessimism-misread\">鄧普頓最悲觀時</a></li></ul></section><div class=\"LearnArticle_related__9qV55\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_relatedTitle__RXfrl\">相關文章</p><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/graham-mr-market-three-checks\">葛拉漢市場先生</a><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/ishikawa-ginzo-lessons\">是川銀藏</a><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/templeton-pessimism-misread\">鄧普頓最悲觀時</a></div></div></article></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[81259,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[89379,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[98924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[10021,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[10528,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d9