li\",\"sec-3\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-3\",\"children\":\"三、和葛拉漢、鄧普頓的距離\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-4\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-4\",\"children\":\"四、作家不是交易員教材的例外\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-5\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-5\",\"children\":\"五、最小動作\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-6\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-6\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-7\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-7\",\"children\":\"總結\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-8\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-8\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\",\"children\":\"邱永漢寫過大量關於錢、工作與市場的公開文字，在台灣流傳很廣。句子短、比喻多，所以常被截成密技。比較穩的讀法是把他當「幫你少被一句話騙走」的作者，不是當報價機器。三句特別常被截：趨勢比面子重要、不要只會一種賺錢方式、以及價格會反映群眾心情。三句都有用，也都能被讀壞。\"}],[],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"b\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\",\"children\":\"本文重點\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"好記的句子要還原成界線，才不會變成口訣\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"趨勢可以承認，承認不是叫你追每一段\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"多元收入與市場判斷是兩題，不要焊在同一張單上\"}]]}]]}],[[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-1\",{\"id\":\"sec-1\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"一、為什麼華文讀者特別常引用他\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"語言近、例子生活化、不故作學院。這是優點，也讓句子容易脫離語境。脫離語境之後，任何漲跌都能貼一句邱永漢，貼完好像做了研究。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"好讀所以好截\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"截完像研究\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"其實只是氣氛\"}]]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-2\",{\"id\":\"sec-2\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"二、三句還原\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"第一，承認大方向，比堅持自己一定對有用——這是認錯，不是追高口號。第二，工作與投資都不要只有一個來源——這是生存，不是叫你同時做十檔。第三，群眾高興與沮喪會進價格——這是市場先生的華文親戚，不是當日反向鈴。\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"被截成\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"比較近的原意\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"誤用\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"跟著趨勢走\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"少跟面子死守\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"每一段都追\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"要會賺錢\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"來源不要單一\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"同時十檔當分散\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"看人心\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"價格含情緒\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"當日反向按鈕\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"他說過所以對\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"句子要配你的規則\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"用名言代替作業\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-3\",{\"id\":\"sec-3\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"三、和葛拉漢、鄧普頓的距離\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"都承認情緒進價格。葛拉漢用合夥人比喻，鄧普頓用悲觀溫度，邱永漢用生活口吻。口吻不同，作業相同：情緒是背景，規則是行動。\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"把名言當背景\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"把規則當行動\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"不要用名言下單\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"figure\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\",\"children\":\"!每段都追!名言當策略!用氣氛代替作業\"}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\",\"children\":\"截壞\"}]]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-4\",{\"id\":\"sec-4\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"四、作家不是交易員教材的例外\"}],[\"$L18\",\"$L19\"]]}],\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\"],\"$L1e\"]}]]}]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"他更常以寫作者與觀察者被閱讀。這反而安全：你比較不會去抄一筆不存在的「邱永漢部位」。危險的是把專欄句子當成當日策略。人物文契約同樣適用：不寫績效，不學神操作，只留界線。\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"觀察者句子當界線\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"不當日策略\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"不去編造他的部位\"}]]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-5\",{\"id\":\"sec-5\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"五、最小動作\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"下次想轉貼一句名言再下單，改成：這句話對應我的哪一條規則？對應不上，就只轉貼，不下單。\"}]]]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-6\",{\"id\":\"sec-6\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}],[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"他的話適不適合長輩讀者？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"口吻友善。仍要提醒：名言不能代替規則與風險上限。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"趨勢那句是不是叫人追高？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"較近的是少為面子死守。追每一段是誤讀。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"和是川銀藏誰比較值得讀？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"一個常被寫成戰役，一個常被寫成生活觀念。都要去神化，都只留檢查。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"名言能不能當教學標題？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"能當鉤子。正文必須還原界線，否則就是再傳播口訣。\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-7\",{\"id\":\"sec-7\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"總結\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"邱永漢的句子好記，所以容易變口訣。還原成：少為面子死守、來源不要單一、情緒會進價格。名言對不上規則，就只讀不下單。\"}]]]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-8\",{\"id\":\"sec-8\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}],[[\"$\",\"ul\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-葛拉漢市場先生\",{\"href\":\"/learn/graham-mr-market-three-checks\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"葛拉漢市場先生\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-是川銀藏\",{\"href\":\"/learn/ishikawa-ginzo-lessons\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"是川銀藏\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-鄧普頓最悲觀時\",{\"href\":\"/learn/templeton-pessimism-misread\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"鄧普頓最悲觀時\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_related__9qV55\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_relatedTitle__RXfrl\",\"children\":\"相關文章\"}],[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"graham-mr-marke